      "message": "BTW, there should ideally also be a way to distinguish the two errors in the Kotlin program, for example the two exception types can be different.\n\nJust to clarify, the Kotlin bindings wrap push/popErrorScope around every call and transform the error into an exception? That would mean they can never be used with remoting implementations (dawn wire, or emdawnwebgpu in a Wasm build).",
